---
/**
 * FeaturedHomeSection.astro — Section 09: Featured Completed Home & Project Breakdown
 * Figma Frame 477 (node 172:1795)
 *
 * Full-width dark section (#131313) with fixed dark dot pattern,
 * featuring a wide architectural kitchen panorama with 15rem offset, 5-row specification table,
 * and a full-screen pinned (100vh, 40rem padding top & bottom) horizontal interactive breakdown gallery
